    "title": "Easter 2026 openings and closings: Are Target, Walmart and Kroger open?",
    "text": "HOLIDAYWhat stores are open on 2026 Easter Sunday? More from Target, Walmart, StarbucksChris Sims Marina JohnsonLouisville Courier JournalUpdated March 31, 2026, 10:15 a.m. ETEaster is just days away, and those with last-minute shopping needs might want to plan ahead. Some stores will be closed for the Christian holiday.Here's what we know about which stores are open and closed in the commonwealth for Easter 2026.What stores are open on Easter Sunday in 2026?Here's a list of stores expected to be open on Easter Sunday. These stores will be open at most locations on Easter, or are expected to be open based on recent holiday participation. Please call ahead to your local store, as there are always exceptions:Our editors independently choose our recommendations. Some content is produced with paid support from a third party, however our editorial decisions remain independent. If you buy through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices and availability may change.",
